      {
         "id": "b",
         "prompt": "There is exactly one time \\( T \\), with \\( 0 < T < 4 \\), at which the x-coordinate of the drone is 8. Write an equation involving an integral that \\( T \\) satisfies, find \\( T \\), and find the slope of the line tangent to the path of the drone at time \\( T \\).",
